'''Treasured Grandchild''' (孫という名の宝物, ''Mago Toiu Na no Takaramono'', '''A Treasure Called a Grandchild''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]].

==Effect==
Cannon Start Level UP (M): Cannon gauge will be filled +4 steps/40% charged.

