==Trivia==
*Treasured Grandchild's Japanese name, Mago Toiu Na no Takaramono ("A Treasure Called a Grandchild"), is a lyric from the [[wikipedia:Enka|''enka'']] ballad "[https://youtu.be/Is5r1DPLX8s Mago]" ("Grandchild").

